test('policy cleanup: original preparation resumes after its window without any continuation record',async t=>{
 const f=await frozenPreparationFixture(t),p=f.prepared.preparation,w=f.prepared.work.find(w=>w.platform==='douyin');
 f.now='2026-10-20T12:42:00.000Z';t.mock.timers.setTime(Date.parse(f.now));
 const accountKey='publishing_browser_account_v2:'+OWNER+':douyin',account=JSON.parse(f.sql.prepare('SELECT value FROM app_state WHERE key=?').get(accountKey).value);
 account.observed_at='2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z';f.sql.prepare('UPDATE app_state SET value=? WHERE key=?').run(JSON.stringify(account),accountKey);
 const claim=await api.claimPublishingPreparation(OWNER,{work_id:w.id,worker:'SYNTHETIC continuing worker'}),packet=await api.readPublishingPreparationMaterials(OWNER,{work_id:w.id});
 assert.equal(packet.package_id,p.package_id);assert.equal(packet.authorization_required,false);assert.equal(packet.publish_allowed,false);
 // Save after a long continuous operation with no full-form proof or duplicate SHA ticket.
 f.now='2026-10-20T13:12:00.000Z';t.mock.timers.setTime(Date.parse(f.now));
 const saved=await api.checkpointPublishingPreparation(OWNER,{work_id:w.id,claim_token:claim.claim_token,phase:'draft_saved',account_id:packet.account_id,account_label:'SYNTHETIC original creator',draft_locator:'SYNTHETIC original retained draft',evidence_url:'https://creator.douyin.com/creator-micro/content/upload',evidence_note:'SYNTHETIC actual original draft saved; not a real publication'});
 assert.equal(saved.work.state,'prepared');assert.equal(saved.work.preflight,undefined);assert.equal(saved.publish_allowed,false);
 assert.equal(f.count('publishing_posts'),0);assert.equal(f.publishCalls.length,0);
 assert.equal(f.sql.prepare("SELECT count(*) n FROM app_state WHERE key LIKE 'publishing_prepared_slot_continuation_v1:%'").get().n,0);
 const staged=await api.armPreparedPublishingSlot(OWNER,{preparation_id:p.id},{...api.browserPublishingAdapter,now:()=>new Date(f.now)});
 assert.equal(staged.no_external_action,true);assert.equal(staged.staged,true);
 const work=(await api.readBrowserPublishingWork(OWNER)).work.find(w=>w.kind==='publish'),c=await api.claimBrowserPublishingWork(OWNER,{work_id:work.id,worker:'SYNTHETIC continuing publisher'});
 const armed=await api.checkpointBrowserPublishingWork(OWNER,{work_id:work.id,claim_token:c.claim_token,phase:'armed',account_id:packet.account_id,local_sha256:packet.video_sha256});
 assert.equal(armed.submission_permit.expires_at,'9999-12-31T23:59:59.999Z');
 assert.equal(preparedPermitAllowsClick(armed.submission_permit,f.now),true);
 await assert.rejects(()=>api.claimBrowserPublishingWork(OWNER,{work_id:work.id,worker:'SYNTHETIC duplicate publisher'}));
 assert.equal(f.publishCalls.length,0);
});

